# Linux/WSL2 package manifest, rendered into ~/Brewfile by Brewfile.tmpl and
# installed by setup.sh's `brew bundle install`.
#
# Curated rather than dumped: every formula here is a tool the configs in this
# repo use or one installed on purpose - no ffmpeg/mpv libraries pulled in as
# dependencies. Only two taps, for the only formulae that need one (acli and
# HashiCorp's terraform, since homebrew-core froze terraform at the last MPL
# release). The apt side - build deps, the word list, Claude Code's sandbox -
# lives in setup.sh. generate-brewfile.sh on this machine replaces the file
# with a `brew bundle dump`; drop anything unwanted from the diff it reports.
